# Cloudflare Workers static-assets deploy: excludes matching files from the
# upload (same syntax as .gitignore). Without this, `npx wrangler deploy`
# uploads the whole repo root as-is -- node_modules included, once Cloudflare's
# build runs `npm install` because it found package.json -- and fails outright
# the moment any single file in there exceeds the Workers per-asset size limit
# (wrangler's own `workerd` binary alone is well over it). None of the paths
# below are part of the deployed site anyway; see README.md's Deploying section.
node_modules
tests
tests-e2e
.github
